        "original_id": "1ec398da-cf5d-59c4-a996-15ff2a86bcbb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dionciel Armstrong, Lasse Hallström\n- Roles: president, CEO, film director\n- Organizations: Mind Vision Productions\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Director\n- Works: My Life as a Dog (Mitt liv som hund), The Cider House Rules\n\nFacts:\n- In 1985, Lasse Hallström was nominated for the Academy Award for Best Director for My Life as a Dog (Mitt liv som hund).\n- In 1999, Lasse Hallström was later nominated for the Academy Award for Best Director for The Cider House Rules.\n- Dionciel Armstrong is currently the president and CEO of Mind Vision Productions.",
